midnight (0.1.0~alpha-6) jammy bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add tenant-safe environment Apply and Deploy with monotonic configuration
    revisions, per-service deployment impact, operation groups, and exact
    idempotent replay.
  * Distinguish source rebuilds from immutable-image redeploys, preserve exact
    rollback and cancellation truth, and reauthorize grouped activity reads.
  * Replace the multi-step draft experience with a reviewed Changes journey,
    live deployment activity, compact service state, setup resume, and
    searchable configuration and resource creation.
  * Extend keyboard, 320-pixel responsive, forced-color, reduced-motion, and
    automated accessibility coverage for the project workspace.
  * This private maintenance artifact remains unsigned; the protected release
    signing workflow is still required before public distribution.

